  "details": "Discovery on VRChat can be difficult for new players. Why not invite some of the VR-famous travellers, photographers and world builders to curate playlists for the world rows?\n\nEven better, create an interface that lets people select their favourite worlds and automatically populate a templated hub world, similar to the one we use for Venice Immersive. You could sell different hub templates, or make more elaborate ones available as a perk for VRC+ members.\n\nThese curated hubs could become jumping-off points for world hops, helping people discover new places through creators and communities they already trust.",
